      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "Running models locally on PCs with NVIDIA GeForce RTX GPUs enables high-performance inference, enhanced data privacy and full control over AI deployment and integration. Tools like LM Studio — free to try — make this possible, giving users an easy way to explore and build with LLMs on their own hardware.",
