      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "The release of LM Studio 0.3.15 brings improved performance for RTX GPUs thanks to CUDA 12.8, significantly improving model load and response times. The update also introduces new developer-focused features, including enhanced tool use via the “ tool_choice” parameter and a redesigned system prompt editor.",
