      "article_id": "article_3cecb5649746a65f",
      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "For example, LM Studio can be integrated with Obsidian , a popular markdown-based knowledge management app. Using community-developed plug-ins like Text Generator and Smart Connections , users can generate content, summarize research and query their own notes — all powered by local LLMs running through LM Studio. These plug-ins connect directly to LM Studio’s local server, enabling fast, private AI interactions without relying on the cloud.",
